 ## Overview
-This article details the neural network architecture and training configuration for the Differentiable Volumetric Rendering (DVR) method [S1, S3, unofficial]. It defines the implicit function network mapping 3D coordinates to occupancy logits and texture values, and specifies the hyperparameters, optimization strategy, and ray-sampling schedules required to train the model from single-view or multi-view inputs [S2][S3, unofficial]. The method builds on [Differentiable Volumetric Rendering (DVR)](775-differentiable-volumetric-rendering-dvr.md) and relates to [DVR Training Losses](809-dvr-training-losses.md) and [Training Losses for Implicit Surface Learning](1526-training-losses-for-implicit-surface-learning.md).
